      "source_quote": "新安王子鸞以盛寵爲南徐州，割吳郡屬焉。",
      "reading": "劉子鸞刺南徐州，割吳郡隸之。",
      "note": "劉子鸞刺南徐州，割吳郡隸之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 18,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence7-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "高選佐史，孝武帝召岱謂之曰：「卿美效夙著，兼資宦已多。",
      "reading": "孝武召岱稱其政績，卿指岱。",
      "note": "孝武召岱稱其政績，卿指岱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 64,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence7-64",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "今欲用卿爲子鸞別駕，總刺史之任，無謂小屈，終當大伸也。」",
      "reading": "孝武欲任岱為子鸞別駕，總刺史之事。",
      "note": "孝武欲任岱為子鸞別駕，總刺史之事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 64,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence7-92",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "帝崩，累遷吏部郎。",
      "reading": "孝武崩後歷吏部郎。",
      "note": "孝武崩後歷吏部郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 92,
      "end_codepoint": 101,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "明帝初，四方反，帝以岱堪幹舊才，除使持節、督西豫州諸軍事、輔國將軍、西豫州刺史。",
      "reading": "宋明帝初，以岱授西豫州刺史等。",
      "note": "宋明帝初，以岱授西豫州刺史等。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 40,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-40",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "尋徙爲冠軍將軍、北徐州刺史，都督北討諸軍事，竝不之官。",
      "reading": "尋改北徐州、督北討等，俱未之官。",
      "note": "尋改北徐州、督北討等，俱未之官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 40,
      "end_codepoint": 67,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-67",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "泰始末，爲吳興太守。",
      "reading": "泰始末出守吳興。",
      "note": "泰始末出守吳興。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 67,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "元徽中，遷使持節、督益寧二州軍事、冠軍將軍、益州刺史。",
      "reading": "元徽中任益州刺史等。",
      "note": "元徽中任益州刺史等。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-104",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "數年，益土安其政。",
      "reading": "數年益州安其政。",
      "note": "數年益州安其政。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 104,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-113",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "徵侍中，領長水校尉，度支尚書，領左軍，遷吏部尚書。",
      "reading": "徵為侍中等，至吏部尚書。",
      "note": "徵為侍中等，至吏部尚書。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 113,
      "end_codepoint": 138,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence8-138",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "王儉爲吏部郎，時專斷曹事，岱每相違執，及儉爲宰相，以此頗不相善。",
      "reading": "王儉與岱處吏部時多所牴牾，為相後仍不相善。",
      "note": "王儉與岱處吏部時多所牴牾，為相後仍不相善。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 138,
      "end_codepoint": 170,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence9-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "尋加散騎常侍。",
      "reading": "加散騎常侍。",
      "note": "加散騎常侍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p009",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 7,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:received_sentence9-7",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD",
      "source_quote": "建元元年，出爲左將軍、吳郡太守。",
      "reading": "齊建元元年479出守吳郡。",
